SUMMARY:Lilac Days at Hulda Klager Lilac Gardens
DESCRIPTION:Lilac Days is April 18 – May 10\, 2026. Each year in the spring\, the Hulda Klager Lilac Gardens hosts Lilac Days to celebrate the beauty of lilacs in bloom. Visitors from around the world stroll through the gardens and buy their favorite lilacs. Lilac Days are the 23 days up to and including Mothers’ Day.  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe gardens are open daily 10:00 a.m. until 4:00 p.m. during Lilac Days and other hours following Lilac Days in the Spring and Summer. See calendar. An admission fee for 2026 Lilac Days of $10 adults is payable at the front gate during Lilac Days. Children 12 years old and under enter free when accompanied by an adult.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/lilac-days-at-hulda-klager-lilac-gardens/2026-04-23/
LOCATION:Hulda Klager Lilac Gardens\, 115 South Pekin Road\, Woodland\, WA\, 98674
CATEGORIES:Family Fun,Kids Calendar,Plants & Nature
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://pdxparent.com/wp-content/uploads/lilac-days.jpg
END:VEVENT
